    "note": "Version 10, locked. Frozen reference Y = 365.2421896698, so J₀ = 8,736,982,783 and Q = 600,000,000,000. Physical Matrix time τ and informational recurrence depth q are separate coordinates; the singular relation is active from launch. The absorption point τ* = 6,251,584,658,434/8,736,982,783 ≈ 715.5313 emerges from the ladder rather than being chosen, and the calendar continues past it. Supersedes every earlier model.",
